# Working documents live outside this public repository: handoffs, review
# prompts, scope documents and the patent coverage analysis the claims
# register's Coverage column is derived from. This stops an accidental
# `git add .` from publishing them.
# tests/test_no_working_documents_in_the_public_repository.py is the check that
# holds it, because an ignore rule is bypassed by `git add -f` and says nothing
# about a file added deliberately.
/claude/
/.claude/
*.docx
*.xlsx
*.pptx
